<title>USA: Washington Real Q1 net rises, EPS flat.</title>
<headline>Washington Real Q1 net rises, EPS flat.</headline>
<dateline>KENSINGTON, Md. 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.22		    $0.22</p>
<p> Net			  7,028		    6,952</p>
<p> Revs			18,498		   14,681</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  31,822		   31,752</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said fund from operations for Q1 1997 totaled $9,457,576, or $0.30 per share, compared to $8,537,547, or $0.27 per share, for the same period last year.</p>
<p>Full name is Washington Real Estate Investment Trust.</p>
</text>
